From 8066ede024f2dced0a2bfa0fd8e1b552d70cc7d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas Bourgoin <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Oct 2025 13:28:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 071/913] plat-stm32mp2: add support of STPMIC2 family

Introduce STPMIC2 driver that controls voltage regulators.
The low level I2C access are handled by the file stpmic2.c.
The file stm32mp_pmic2.c is the driver supporting the 3 PMICs from the
STPMIC2 family:
- stpmic25
- stpmic1l
- stpmic2l

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 475abaf4c40005b7d1d305afefe18d53de99b1ed plat-stm32mp2: add support of STPMIC2 family]
Change-Id: I4588dc70aee16156c9685bdee47740b722d723c3
Signed-off-by: Pascal Paillet <p.paillet@foss.st.com>
Signed-off-by: Thomas Bourgoin <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
